From 0d2b5a9943ec9f648512f4d18e5684341b0fd299 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 01 Feb 2021 16:09:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-31170] greco: remove goya2 command and config

Since greco commands are introduced, this patch add changes
to remove goya2 related command and configuration.

Change-Id: I4b576b41db7637b232f08847c88cc989006016e8
